OWNERS of MERCURITY FINTECH HOLDING INC. </FONT>AMERICAN DEPOSITARY SHARES (&ldquo;<U>ADSs</U>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

